d 情境內流程比對完成率; body §10.2 uses the same phrase.\",\n    \"Body §4.6–§4.7 records S-16–S-18 complement as not completed (HOLD) and includes 已補課 status; R02 §8.1 only states that complement options were provided.\",\n    \"R02 table 5-1 still lists 證照影本、發證單位回覆 as C evidence forms; body table 3-1B uses the same future-real evidence labels, while body §6 states real copies/replies remain HOLD/UNKNOWN and the current synthetic form is 合成查證表.\",\n    \"Blueprint-only planning statements without a body counterpart remain uncorroborated (e.g. §4.1 trigger 機制彙整截止日後 5 個工作天, §4.4 lecturer role wording, §13.5 layout requirements).\",\n    \"Appendix 5-3 simulated-practice state list omits HOLD, which body includes.\"\n  ],\n  \"truth_boundary\": \"Reviewed only as CANDIDATE/SAMPLE sidecar metadata. All REAL originals, issuer replies, certificate facts, operational roles, and outcomes remain HOLD/UNKNOWN. No formal Association acceptance, approval, or review PASS is asserted.\",\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Read-only review of supplied Markdown/JSON files and computed file hashes; no DOCX bytes were inspected, modified, or re-reviewed.\",\n    \"No formal Human/Association acceptance is asserted.\",\n    \"Findings are limited to the supplied R01, R02, body R03, patch response, and patch receipt; no hidden source files were used.\"\n  ]\n}","time":{"start":1792326582938,"end":1792326593854}}}
